# SESS-8 · The terminal goes away: imece quits, nothing of it left running,
# a process that left a session included.
# The runner fails the case when anything still works in its directory
# five seconds after its terminal went.
start
see any key: close
key Escape
key /
type find() should ignore case in shelf.py
key Enter
see claude-1 said done.
key Escape Escape
# A process that left a session, as a `nohup … &` server does: it carries
# the session's mark (record 129), and the quit must end it, however
# imece is quit.
until 30 python3 -I $ACC_SOURCE/tools/acceptance/marked.py start $ACC_CASE
# The terminal goes while imece waits for a key after a `!cmd` (it spun
# there at full CPU, deaf to SIGTERM, until 2026-11-10).
key /
type !true
key Enter
see [imece] exit 0 · 
stop
# Until 2026-11-11 a closed terminal made imece's last words panic, the
# process aborted, and what carried the mark lived on.
until 15 python3 -I $ACC_SOURCE/tools/acceptance/marked.py gone $ACC_CASE
